[Music]  the winter season of anime is almost  done so it's time to look ahead it's  probably going to help us in coping with  the fact that demon slayer is done for  now and once the season's over attack on  titan will be as well but the fact still  remains that in a few more weeks winter  will give way to spring and i think it's  appropriate that i get you hyped up for  the stuff we've got coming next season  so it's time once more for vinitube to  put the spotlight on the new anime that  we'll be getting but hey before we start  i'm feeling a little hungry well it's a  good thing we've got today's video  sponsors tokyo treat and sakurako to  deal with that tokyo tree and sakurako  are subscription-based snack boxes that  give you the authentic japanese  experience right in the comfort of your  own home for an affordable subscription  price you get a snack box featuring the  best of japanese sweets culture  delivered to your doorstep every month  tokyo treat gives you a taste of modern  japan by going down this route you'll  get a box that features 20 of the latest  suites that epitomize the concept of  cool japan on the other hand if you  prefer the more traditional side of  japan you can consider sakurako the  circle rocco box goes beyond just sweets  and comes with its own set of artisan  snacks we're talking japanese tea and  even tableware that you can use once  you're through with the box and yeah you  guessed it this month's theme is sakura  so expect many sakura flavoured snacks  so why not be like me and subscribe to  both of them you know enjoy the best of  both sides of japan let me give you a  hand check out the link in the  description box and use code vinnie to  get five dollars off your first box i  guarantee you won't regret spending a  cent on this super good deal  opening our list is skeleton night in  another world  now that's a title that doesn't leave  much to guessing it's exactly what it  says in the title and it's next in line  of the video game it's the kind that  we've been getting for years now gamer  falls asleep wakes up as a skeleton  tonight much to his dismay taken on the  name ark he then meets an elven warrior  who sets him off on his adventure  overpowered character in an isakai  that's taking on a skeletal appearance  doesn't that remind you of overlord i  mean it sure does for me but what i  appreciate with skeleton knight is the  rather lighthearted star it's quite  comedic and i can't get enough of ark's  antics as he takes the knight part of  his name quite literally it's a fine  read as source material nothing too  groundbreaking but something that will  be fun to watch especially if you enjoy  overpowered characters in isakai ninth  in line is love after world domination  [Music]  tell me if you've heard this before two  members of battling forces always find  themselves at each other's throats  however once the cameras stop rolling  and their public life fades the two  pursue their forbidden love our unlucky  heroes this time are fudo of the gelato  5 and desumi of the villainous  organization gekko being on opposite  sides of two factions is difficult  enough but imagine upping the ante with  their roles as heroes and villains their  schedules and assignments only serve to  add more problems in their road to love  but the two are determined to make this  relationship work and not even the most  diabolical plans of world domination  will stop them it's a setup we've seen  quite a lot already but love after world  domination looks to add to the library  of these romeo and juliet-esque stories  with its focus on tokusatsu power  rangers parodies it's quite a funny take  on a story beat that we've grown to be  familiar with and it could be an easy  watch for you to enjoy this season  [Music]  is a lot of things small cute and  adorable all serve well to describe her  however she's also a ball of surprises  completely ignoring the concept of  personal space and being filled with  antics that are bound to drive anyone  mad thankfully super imaginative rado is  perfectly equipped to handle any storm  ahanen whips up this soon leads to a  misunderstanding that sets forth one of  the most unusual friendships between two  peculiar personalities thus begins a  hilarious rom-com where the two dimwits  and the very diverse cast around them  show off some of the craziness that you  wouldn't expect to see out of the  seemingly mundane situations therefore  making it a perfect watch if you're  looking to unwind with some school  wackiness  in seventh place we have a couple of  cuckoos  [Music]  nagi always seem like he doesn't belong  with the rest of the hyper-energetic  umino household well it shouldn't  surprise anyone that this introverted  young man really isn't a member of the  family he's been switched at birth with  another baby as crazy as that sounds  what's even crazier is that nagi has  been arranged to marry social media star  erica armano that's a tad bit  unfortunate for nagi however because he  has his sights set on another girl his  intelligent classmate hiro segalva looks  like our protagonist has found himself  caught in yet another world wind of love  and it's going to take a miracle and all  sorts of hijinks to navigate his way out  of this now i haven't read too much of  the material but it seems to be going  with the same feel as nisakoi and rent a  girlfriend did probably something to  look out for if you enjoyed those shows  [Music]  our sixth most anticipated new anime is  aowashi  here comes the sports show of the season  i've briefly talked about aawashi before  and i think it rightfully finds its  place as one of the most anticipated new  anime this spring like many aspiring  athletes ashita awai dreams big  unfortunately his dreams of getting into  a high school with a good club never  came into fruition due to an incident  that's his fault however the game's  never over until it's over and his talon  catches the eye of some talent scouts  who give him a second chance as during  the typical high school tournament  setting awashi takes the sports genre  further with a focus on actual ball  clubs and a greater emphasis on realism  not only does it give you a glimpse of  the football club system in japan it  also provides some good character growth  to accompany it if you feel that the  typical sport anime is way too  shonen-esque this could be the  alternative you're waiting for  now  fifth on the list is tomodachi game  do you trust your friends with your  lives that's the question posed to us by  the appropriately titled tomodachi game  when yuichi and his friends find  themselves kidnapped by a manabukin  they're forced to play what the mascot  calls friendship games games that will  test their bonds and trust with each  other or to settle a large debt and  snuff out a traitor it's here that they  soon find out that perhaps their  friendship isn't as strong after all and  things look even shakier after a series  of betrayals further proving the adage  to keep your friends close but your  enemies closer it's time for the big  brain pseudo psychological show of the  season domination game starts off slow  but it does pick up quickly holding me  in constant anticipation of what's gonna  happen next i really appreciated the  high stakes mysteries and the characters  in manga form so here's to hoping that  everything translates well in anime  format too  [Music]  at number four is summertime render  [Music]  stood out for some time loot thrillers  summertime render is here for you  shinfei didn't expect much in his return  to his hometown of wakayama he made it  back to attend a funeral of a childhood  friend but some things about ushio's  death seem a miss the forces of darkness  are at work and creeping shadows  threaten the lives of those he holds  dear it's a family reunion gone to hell  armed with the uncanny ability of  turning back time upon death it's up to  him to stop the encroaching darkness and  lead everyone to the greatest happy  ending if you're up for something like  erased or re-zero this is a show you  ought to be on the lookout for i think  summertime render improved on some  aspects of those such as adding even  greater stakes to the mix and upping the  whole mystery aspect i'm calling this to  be a sleeper hit for the season and i  wasn't surprised about the fact that  many people are looking forward to it  finds itself as the third most  anticipated anime this spring season  today  [Music]  at first glance you think that shikimori  and izumi are your typical lovey-dovey  couple they walk home from school they  flirt they tease each other a perfect  couple if you will however izumi is the  type of guy who finds himself in a bind  often and that's when the other  shikimori comes out going from cute to  cool in an instant shikimori knows what  she wants and she knows damn well how to  get it i'm not gonna stand there and  pretend that this show is anything like  the next big breakthrough in the world  of rom-com what i do love about this  show however is how it shows off some  self-awareness and subverts from some  expectations i'm positive we all see  those like yandere vibes already but the  show does a great job playing the  balance between those tropes and the  more wholesome side of teen romance it's  a fun series that goes beyond what you'd  expect from fluffy high school romance  shikimori is not just a cutie indeed  [Music]  the second most anticipated anime is not  a series but a movie  [Music]  it's finally here the anime movie  spectacular that combines some of the  greatest in the industry is here to take  the world by storm bubble takes us to a  tokyo that looks nothing like the  bustling metropolis that we know bubbles  have descended breaking apart the laws  of gravity and turning tokyo into a hot  spot for the coolest sport in town  parkour team battles that have  participants leap from building to  building hotshot parkour prodigy hikibi  then takes one risk too many and finds  himself plummeting down into the sea  where he meets the mysterious ulta a  chance meeting or a union crossed by  fate whatever it is it's this encounter  that opens them up to the truth of the  world name recognition can only take you  so far but from what i've seen in the  trailers bubble looks to be an amazing  title that could be a contender for  original anime movie of the year the  plot synopsis does have potential for  some mystery and romance and i'm really  liking how beautiful everything looks  something you want to keep your eyes out  for  our most anticipated new anime this  spring is spy family  [Music]  spy family has been building steam for  quite some time now the manga has become  so popular that now's the time to strike  with one of the biggest hits we'll see  this year spy family in a nutshell is  about a secret agent forming a pretend  family for the sake of his mission turns  out that his pretend family is made up  of an undercover assassin and a child  with psychic powers what makes spy  family so good to catapulter into the  number one spot on this list the concept  of a fake family going undercover for  their own purposes may not seem as novel  but spy family is a show that nails it  perfectly i just adore the dynamic  between the main characters and it's  truly a joy to watch the contrast and  balance between them dealing with their  assignments and the everyday challenges  of family life it's quite ridiculous but  in a good way and it's a complete joy to  read on a semi-related note i'm feeling  some garguja vibes here despite the  premises almost having nothing in common  do you  mean  have you hopped onto the spy family hype  train tell me and more in the comments  section below comments are good for  views and the algorithm you know you can  also drop by the channel's many many  social media avenues we have a discord  for giveaways an instagram and a patreon  all accessible via the description box  come by and have some fun don't forget  to check out our sponsors of this video  monthly japanese snack subscription  boxes tokyo treat and sakuraku links are  in the description that's going to do it  for this video however i thank you for  watching and i hope that you'll go check  out the channel for the other videos  that may be to your liking i'd love to  see you on the next video but till then  this is vinnie tube signing off

